      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SEASIDE BOULEVARD (4) drew on the back row and chased along the sprint lane for resuming fifth in a heat of this series at Wagga last week. That was her first appearance since her second in July's Queensland Oaks and she races well second-up so should be improved. Proven at this circuit and distance and should get her chance from this draw. YIRRADIVA (12) returns to the city in good form including a win at Wagga two back. Chased a smart one when second in a heat of this series at Bathurst last start. The wide draw hurts but she is capable. ONE MORE REASON (7) has been ticking along well including a win from a similar barrier here two back. Can be competitive. FORGIVE AND FORGET (3) improved last start and will be fitter again so include.",
